---
import '../styles/v3-pages.css';
import V3CommercialHeader from '../components/V3CommercialHeader.astro';
import V3CommercialFooter from '../components/V3CommercialFooter.astro';
import V3Seo from '../components/V3Seo.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const demo = `${base}demo/`;
const pilot = `${base}piloto/`;
const security = `${base}seguridad/`;
const scope = `${base}alcance/`;
---
<!doctype html><html lang="es"><head><V3Seo title="Empresa · IsiVoltPro" description="La visión de IsiVoltPro: software técnico práctico para autónomos y pequeñas empresas, diseñado alrededor del activo, el trabajo de campo y la trazabilidad." path={`${base}empresa/`} />
<style is:inline>
.company-board{background:#fff;overflow:hidden}.company-board .page-shell{width:min(1180px,calc(100% - 44px))}.company-hero{position:relative;padding:88px 0 82px;background:radial-gradient(circle at 78% 24%,rgba(100,89,229,.13),transparent 27%),radial-gradient(circle at 95% 58%,rgba(50,194,144,.10),transparent 19%),#fff}.company-hero__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.82fr 1.18fr;gap:74px;align-items:center}.company-kicker{display:inline-flex;padding:7px 10px;border:1px solid #e9ecf3;border-radius:999px;color:#70798a;font-size:9px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase}.company-hero h1{margin:15px 0 18px;font:800 clamp(50px,4.8vw,70px)/.98 var(--v3-font-display,system-ui);letter-spacing:-.064em}.company-hero h1 span{display:block;color:transparent;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#6b58df,#4aa7d2 52%,#35bd8f);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text}.company-hero p{max-width:540px;margin:0;color:#747f92;font-size:14px;line-height:1.74}.company-hero .btn--primary{background:#111827;border-color:#111827;color:#fff}.company-scene{position:relative;min-height:470px}.company-scene::before{content:'';position:absolute;inset:8% -4% 0 10%;border-radius:42px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(99,83,224,.14),rgba(51,163,211,.08) 50%,rgba(44,191,141,.11));filter:blur(28px)}.company-scene__panel{position:absolute;inset:24px 24px 24px 42px;border:1px solid #e5e9f2;border-radius:28px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.95);box-shadow:0 34px 84px rgba(58,67,109,.16);overflow:hidden;backdrop-filter:blur(14px)}.company-scene__bar{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:16px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid #edf0f5}.company-scene__bar strong{font-size:11px}.company-scene__bar small{color:#919aaa;font-size:8px}.company-scene__workspace{display:grid;grid-template-columns:112px 1fr;min-height:365px}.company-scene__nav{padding:18px 12px;background:#10182f;color:#bac3d7}.company-scene__nav strong{display:block;margin:0 8px 16px;color:#fff;font-size:10px}.company-scene__nav span{display:block;margin:5px 0;padding:8px 9px;border-radius:9px;font-size:8px}.company-scene__nav span:first-of-type{background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(67,101,255,.28),rgba(109,74,255,.22));color:#fff}.company-scene__content{padding:18px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fafbff)}.company-scene__kpis{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:9px}.company-scene__kpi{padding:12px;border:1px solid #e8ebf2;border-radius:13px;background:#fff}.company-scene__kpi small{display:block;color:#8992a2;font-size:7px}.company-scene__kpi strong{display:block;margin-top:4px;font-size:17px}.company-scene__body{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 145px;gap:12px;height:245px;padding-top:12px}.company-scene__copy{display:grid;align-content:center;padding:20px;border-radius:18px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#f8faff,#f4f1ff 55%,#effbf6)}.company-scene__copy small{color:#7e899b;font-size:8px;font-weight:800}.company-scene__copy strong{margin-top:8px;font-size:24px;line-height:1.05}.company-scene__copy p{margin-top:9px;color:#768195;font-size:9px;line-height:1.5}.company-scene__image{overflow:hidden;border-radius:17px;background:#f4f7fb}.company-scene__image img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}.company-float{position:absolute;z-index:3;padding:11px 13px;border:1px solid #e5e8f0;border-radius:15px;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 15px 36px rgba(54,63,103,.14)}.company-float strong{display:block;font-size:10px}.company-float small{display:block;margin-top:3px;color:#8b94a3;font-size:7px}.company-float--a{left:0;top:88px}.company-float--b{right:-4px;top:34px}.company-float--c{right:4px;bottom:28px}.company-float--a strong{color:#6656dc}.company-float--b strong{color:#26ab7a}.company-float--c strong{color:#2d9bb5}
.company-principles{padding:72px 0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fbfcff,#f8f9fd);border-top:1px solid #eef0f5}.company-section-head{max-width:760px;margin-bottom:33px}.company-section-head h2{margin:10px 0 12px;font:800 clamp(36px,3.9vw,54px)/1.02 var(--v3-font-display,system-ui);letter-spacing:-.055em}.company-section-head p{margin:0;color:#768195;line-height:1.68}.company-principle-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px}.company-principle{position:relative;overflow:hidden;min-height:250px;padding:27px;border:1px solid #e7eaf2;border-radius:23px;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 17px 44px rgba(54,64,102,.07)}.company-principle::after{content:'';position:absolute;width:140px;height:140px;right:-60px;bottom:-70px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(104,86,223,.08)}.company-principle:nth-child(2)::after{background:rgba(45,157,184,.08)}.company-principle:nth-child(3)::after{background:rgba(34,167,119,.08)}.company-principle i{width:44px;height:44px;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:14px;background:#f0edff;color:#6754da;font-style:normal;font-weight:850}.company-principle:nth-child(2) i{background:#eef7fb;color:#2d9db8}.company-principle:nth-child(3) i{background:#eaf9f3;color:#22a777}.company-principle h3{margin:18px 0 8px;font-size:18px}.company-principle p{margin:0;color:#7b8698;font-size:11px;line-height:1.65}
.company-story-section{padding:78px 0;background:#fff}.company-story-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.08fr .92fr;gap:18px}.company-story-card{position:relative;min-height:320px;padding:34px;border:1px solid #e7eaf2;border-radius:26px;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 18px 48px rgba(54,64,102,.07)}.company-story-card--color{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#f2f6ff,#f3efff 52%,#eefaf5)}.company-story-card h3{margin:12px 0 12px;font:800 clamp(28px,3vw,40px)/1.03 var(--v3-font-display,system-ui);letter-spacing:-.045em}.company-story-card p{margin:0;color:#747f92;line-height:1.72}.company-trust{padding:72px 0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fbfcff,#f8f9fd)}.company-trust-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px}.company-trust-card{padding:24px;border:1px solid #e7eaf2;border-radius:20px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fbfcff);box-shadow:0 14px 36px rgba(54,64,102,.05)}.company-trust-card strong{display:block;font-size:15px}.company-trust-card p{margin:8px 0 0;color:#7b8698;font-size:10px;line-height:1.6}.company-trust-card a{display:block;margin-top:15px;color:#6256d7;font-size:9px;font-weight:800}.company-final{padding:72px 0}.company-final .callout{background:linear-gradient(120deg,#f3f6ff,#f4f0ff 48%,#eefaf5)}
@media(max-width:900px){.company-hero__grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.company-scene{min-height:440px}.company-principle-grid,.company-trust-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.company-story-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}@media(max-width:560px){.company-board .page-shell{width:min(100% - 28px,1180px)}.company-hero{padding:58px 0}.company-hero h1{font-size:clamp(42px,12vw,56px)}.company-scene{min-height:360px}.company-scene__panel{inset:18px 2px 18px 12px}.company-scene__workspace{grid-template-columns:78px 1fr;min-height:300px}.company-scene__nav{padding:14px 7px}.company-scene__content{padding:12px}.company-scene__kpis{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.company-scene__kpi:nth-child(3){display:none}.company-scene__body{grid-template-columns:1fr 92px;height:210px}.company-scene__copy{padding:14px}.company-scene__copy strong{font-size:18px}.company-float{display:none}.company-principle-grid,.company-trust-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style></head><body><V3CommercialHeader />
<main class="company-board">
<section class="company-hero"><div class="page-shell company-hero__grid"><div><span class="company-kicker">Empresa</span><h1>Software técnico para<span>el trabajo real.</span></h1><p>IsiVoltPro nace de una idea sencilla: la información útil de una instalación debe acompañar al activo durante toda su vida, no perderse entre llamadas, chats, fotos sueltas y hojas de cálculo.</p><div class="page-hero__actions"><a class="btn btn--primary" href={demo}>Ver cómo funciona</a><a class="btn" href="#principios">Nuestra visión</a></div></div><div class="company-scene" aria-label="Del trabajo en campo al histórico"><div class="company-scene__panel"><div class="company-scene__bar"><strong>IsiVoltPro · contexto técnico</strong><small>Vista conceptual</small></div><div class="company-scene__workspace"><aside class="company-scene__nav" aria-hidden="true"><strong>IsiVoltPro</strong><span>Resumen</span><span>Activos</span><span>OT</span><span>Revisiones</span><span>Documentos</span></aside><div class="company-scene__content"><div class="company-scene__kpis"><div class="company-scene__kpi"><small>Activos con contexto</small><strong>128</strong></div><div class="company-scene__kpi"><small>OT cerradas</small><strong>46</strong></div><div class="company-scene__kpi"><small>Histórico</small><strong>100%</strong></div></div><div class="company-scene__body"><div class="company-scene__copy"><small>DEL CAMPO AL HISTÓRICO</small><strong>El contexto viaja con el activo.</strong><p>Aviso, OT, evidencia y resultado quedan unidos para la siguiente intervención.</p></div><div class="company-scene__image"><img src={`${base}media/tecnico-movil.svg`} alt="Técnico consultando información de un activo desde el móvil"/></div></div></div></div></div><div class="company-float company-float--a"><strong>Campo</strong><small>Donde ocurre el trabajo</small></div><div class="company-float company-float--b"><strong>Contexto</strong><small>Activo + OT + documentos</small></div><div class="company-float company-float--c"><strong>Histórico</strong><small>Lo aprendido permanece</small></div></div></div></section>
<section class="company-principles" id="principios"><div class="page-shell"><header class="company-section-head"><span class="company-kicker">Principios de producto</span><h2>Primero resolver. Después impresionar.</h2><p>La interfaz puede ser visual y moderna, pero no debe obligar al técnico a trabajar para el software. El producto debe adaptarse al trabajo y reducir pasos innecesarios.</p></header><div class="company-principle-grid"><article class="company-principle"><i>01</i><h3>El activo es el contexto</h3><p>Documentos, avisos, OT y revisiones tienen más valor cuando sabemos exactamente a qué equipo pertenecen.</p></article><article class="company-principle"><i>02</i><h3>El móvil es herramienta</h3><p>Consultar, registrar y cerrar debe funcionar delante del equipo, no solo desde un despacho.</p></article><article class="company-principle"><i>03</i><h3>El histórico es conocimiento</h3><p>Una intervención terminada mejora la información disponible para la siguiente.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="company-story-section"><div class="page-shell company-story-grid"><article class="company-story-card company-story-card--color"><span class="company-kicker">El problema</span><h3>Muchas herramientas, poca conexión.</h3><p>WhatsApp para avisos, Excel para inventarios, fotos en el móvil, PDFs en carpetas y memoria personal para recordar qué ocurrió la última vez. Cada pieza puede funcionar por separado, pero juntas generan fricción.</p></article><article class="company-story-card"><span class="company-kicker">La propuesta</span><h3>Una capa común para el trabajo técnico.</h3><p>IsiVoltPro conecta clientes, instalaciones, activos, avisos, órdenes, revisiones y documentación. No se trata de sustituir todo de golpe, sino de crear una fuente de verdad que pueda crecer con el negocio.</p></article></div></section>
<section class="company-trust"><div class="page-shell"><header class="company-section-head"><span class="company-kicker">Confianza sin decoración</span><h2>Decimos qué está listo y qué falta.</h2><p>Mientras no existan clientes, métricas, certificaciones o precios publicables, la confianza debe venir de límites visibles y decisiones comprobables.</p></header><div class="company-trust-grid"><article class="company-trust-card"><strong>Alcance público</strong><p>Separamos núcleo, ampliaciones y capacidades todavía en desarrollo.</p><a href={scope}>Ver alcance →</a></article><article class="company-trust-card"><strong>Piloto con salida</strong><p>El proceso contempla parar si no aporta valor o falta una capacidad crítica.</p><a href={pilot}>Ver piloto →</a></article><article class="company-trust-card"><strong>Seguridad sin claims ficticios</strong><p>Distinguimos arquitectura prevista de controles que aún deben validarse.</p><a href={security}>Ver seguridad →</a></article></div></div></section>
<section class="company-final"><div class="page-shell"><div class="callout"><div><h2>Queremos construir IsiVoltPro con gente que hace este trabajo.</h2><p>La demo debe ayudarnos a comprobar si el enfoque encaja antes de hablar de implantación o condiciones comerciales.</p></div><a class="btn btn--primary" href={demo}>Ver el recorrido de demo →</a></div></div></section>
</main><V3CommercialFooter /></body></html>